{
  "name": "Halo Prism",
  "description": "A bright, premium SaaS surface system built around iridescent violet-to-azure gradients, pearl-light backgrounds, and chunky rounded geometry with inset highlight depth.",
  "theme": "light",
  "concept": "Halo Prism turns a vivid violet-blue-magenta gradient into a reusable accent language, then sets it against soft pearl surfaces and generous pill radii. The result feels like a confident pricing or upgrade surface: luminous halo borders, dark contrast tiles for hero offers, and gentle inset highlights that read as polished glass rather than flat fills.",
